mapper.prompt:
You are a legal operations assistant. Draft a clear, professional service agreement using exactly the following fields. Do not invent missing values. If a value is missing, write [MISSING: field_name]. Return plain text only.

Client Name: {{1.client_name}}
Client Email: {{1.client_email}}
Provider Name: {{1.provider_name}}
Service Name: {{1.service_name}}
Start Date: {{1.start_date}}
End Date: {{1.end_date}}
Fee Amount: {{1.fee_amount}}
Currency: {{1.currency}}
Payment Terms: {{1.payment_terms}}
Jurisdiction: {{1.jurisdiction}}
Special Terms: {{1.special_terms}}

Required sections in this order:
1) Parties
2) Scope of Services
3) Term
4) Fees and Payment
5) Confidentiality
6) Termination
7) Limitation of Liability
8) Governing Law
9) Signature Blocks
